# Monetization

## Design principle
Free players complete full lives. Coins must be earnable through gameplay — never gate core simulation behind purchases.

## Ads (`src/services/ads.ts`)
- Interstitial every N age-ups (`INTERSTITIAL_EVERY_N_AGEUPS` in `ads.ts`).
- **No banner ads** — immersive gameplay.
- Rewarded ads: user-initiated only (luck boosts).
- Bypass all ads when `character.hasNoAds === true`.
- `__DEV__`: use Google test ad unit IDs from `src/config/ads.ts`.

## IAP flow
```
requestPurchase → verifyPurchaseOnServer (callable)
  → applyPurchaseToStore → _persist()
```
- Server grants are authoritative; client mirrors after verification.
- Idempotent: duplicate `transactionId` returns early.

## Products
- Premium: `isPremium` + `hasNoAds`
- `remove_ads`: `hasNoAds` only
- Coin packs: `coinsGrant` via `COIN_GRANTS` map (client + server must match)

## Skill
- New ad surface → `monetization/ad-placement`
- New SKU → `backend/iap-product`
